+     * here is 0 maps only when ROM3 (the 48K BASIC ROM) is paged in; and
+     * the entry points of 0xBB marked ROM3 (0x3DXX, 0x056A, 0x04D7, 0x0562,
+     * 0x04C6) likewise. NextZXOS 2.09 sets 0xB9 to 0 and calls its own
+     * RST 8 with ROM0 paged in, which must not reach the divMMC. */
